## User

The largest element of a list of natural numbers, or 0 for the empty list.

## Type

type
```agda
maxList : List ℕ → ℕ
```

## Term

```agda
maxList [] = 0
maxList (x ∷ xs) = max x (maxList xs)
```

## agda

```agda
maxList-[] : ∀ xs → maxList [] ≡ 0
maxList-[] [] = refl
maxList-[] (x ∷ xs) = maxList-[] xs
```

## agda

```agda
maxList-∷ : ∀ xs → maxList (x ∷ xs) ≡ max x (maxList xs)
maxList-∷ [] = refl
maxList-∷ (x ∷ xs) = maxList-∷ xs
```

## agda

```agda
maxList-[]-∷ : ∀ xs → maxList (x ∷ xs) ≡ max x (maxList xs)
maxList-[]-∷
